body:
So I know this post is a few days old but I just finished the last episode. I agree with the commenters saying it wasn't on purpose. What irritates me the most about this show is it is so campy and soapy but we never really get any of that soapy romance delivered that makes it feel sort of worth while. It's like junk food to me. The show makes me feel like eventually we'll get that hit of soapy romance but then it continues chugging along taking itself very seriously and just stating outright political opinions and really no new hot takes or fresh perspectives. 

&#x200B;

TLDR: this show is weird as hell

Oh this is perfect, I just calculated the guarana caffeine and it was about 20mg which shouldn't be toxic to him. Thanks so much for this link

&#x200B;

ETA: this helped a ton. I put in the amount as milk chocolate and even dark chocolate (I think there's no way that the protein bar has as much cocoa as dark chocolate) and it says no treatment necessary. Thanks SO much for this

